"This research facility on Moon Thegund was Joe's lab for about sixteen years."
"There Joe worked at 'containing demonic energies for certain wealthy benefactors'."
"Artonan authorities confiscated the lab and sold it to the Yipalck Corporation."
"It sits in a huge depression, ringed by a reflective perimeter building with a narrow door."
"The perimeter building has hotel-like residential halls, mudrooms and a common room with toys."
"Ten to twenty buildings are inside, among them greenhouse domes and two gray pentagon dishes."
"An underground ramp serves as its exit."
"It is in a high chaos area, which Thegund's System warns ranks below B not to approach."
"Yipalck evacuated only its own employees by ship; Joe's loyalists were told to stay."
"Thenn-ar led the loyalists who stayed, and Alden evacuated them one a night."
"Joe sent bombs to 'strategically tidy' the lab so Yipalck couldn't take his work."
